    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942840/extras/7561742057fbcabfb8963fb0bb30e5e0.avif?t=1737355013\" width=460 height=215 /></span><br><strong>Our Little Friend</strong> is a short horror game that follows your &quot;Little Robot Friend&quot; and it's completely trustworthy and reliable instructions for some silly and innocent lil' games!<br>Will you be his friend till the end?<br><br>This game contains multiple endings and various minigames that your friend suggests. But something seems to be off about it!<br>Keep an eye out, because who knows what will change in the future?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find and complete different endings!<br></li><li>Find yourself in different minigames!<br></li><li>Decent Replayability!<br></li><li>Unlock more minigames by playing the game!</li></ul>",
